Bundled third-party text
------------------------
src/theogony/seeds/hesiod_theogony.txt is Hesiod's Theogony in the English
translation of Hugh G. Evelyn-White (Loeb Classical Library, 1914), which is in
the public domain. The text was taken from Project Gutenberg eBook #348 with the
Project Gutenberg header and licence removed, as that licence permits for a
public-domain work; it is therefore not distributed as a Project Gutenberg eBook.
